{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join\u00a0the\u00a0Star\u00a0Trade\u00a0Organization,\u00a0get\u00a0the\u00a0&quot;Star\u00a0Trade\u00a0Chamber\u00a0Pass&quot;\u00a0to\u00a0become\u00a0a\u00a0member\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0organization,\u00a0enhance\u00a0interstellar\u00a0navigation\u00a0and\u00a0resource\u00a0exchange\u00a0with\u00a0the\u00a0Chamber,\u00a0this\u00a0DLC\u00a0expansion\u00a0includes:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expanded\u00a0&quot;Automatic\u00a0Route&quot;\u00a0function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automatic\u00a0routes\u00a0can\u00a0be\u00a0established\u00a0between\u00a0their\u00a0own\u00a0planets\u00a0to\u00a0achieve\u00a0continuous\u00a0automatic\u00a0transportation\u00a0of\u00a0resources,\u00a0thereby\u00a0automating\u00a0the\u00a0interplanetary\u00a0resource\u00a0network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357800/extras/\u81ea\u52a8\u822a\u7ebf-e.png?t=1743473406\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand\u00a0the\u00a0Resource\u00a0replacement\u00a0function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When\u00a0resources\u00a0are\u00a0extremely\u00a0unbalanced,\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0use\u00a0this\u00a0function\u00a0to\u00a0adjust\u00a0resource\u00a0allocation\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a01:1\u00a0ratio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357800/extras/\u8d44\u6e90\u7f6e\u6362-e.png?t=1743473406\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional\u00a0&quot;trade\u00a0market&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The\u00a0Chamber\u00a0of\u00a0Commerce\u00a0will\u00a0open\u00a0a\u00a0trading\u00a0market\u00a0once\u00a0a\u00a0day,\u00a0allowing\u00a0the\u00a0use\u00a0of\u00a0&quot;star\u00a0currency&quot;\u00a0resources\u00a0to\u00a0exchange\u00a0for\u00a0a\u00a0certain\u00a0number\u00a0of\u00a0other\u00a0resources\u00a0or\u00a0items.</p><p class=\"bb_para